00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:05,860
dreamer, but suddenly he stopped having dreams.

243
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:08,780
I asked him what had happened.

244
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:15,020
It turned out that his brother died of a heart attack, and he never expected that

245
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:18,220
such a terrible thing would happen to a young person.

246
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:24,080
Generally, when there was some frightening event, and to dream about it was too

247
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:27,680
terrible, people prefer not to dream about it.

248
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:34,060
Actually, the worst thing you can do is stop dreaming, because it means that the bad

249
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:38,040
